<title>NETHERLANDS: PIRELLI CONFIRMS BID FOR P. TYRE .</title>
<headline>PIRELLI CONFIRMS BID FOR P. TYRE .</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pirelli SpA confirmed on Monday that it would make a public offer of 19.50 guilders per share for all outstanding shares of Pirelli Tyre Holding NV.</p>
<p>Milan-listed Pirelli SpA currently holds 81 percent of the shares in Amsterdam-listed Pirelli Tyre Holding.</p>
